### Send a message
POST {{host}}/chat/{{conversationId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Hello from Gimlee Chat!"
}

### Get chat history
GET {{host}}/chat/{{conversationId}}/messages?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get chat history (backwards cursor pagination)
# Retrieves messages older than beforeId (chronologically backwards).
GET {{host}}/chat/{{conversationId}}/messages?limit=20&beforeId={{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get chat history (forward back-fill after reconnect)
# Retrieves messages newer than afterId (chronological order) to recover messages missed during disconnect.
GET {{host}}/chat/{{conversationId}}/messages?limit=20&afterId={{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Indicate typing
POST {{host}}/chat/{{conversationId}}/typing
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Subscribe to chat events (SSE)
# Opens a persistent Server-Sent Events stream for real-time delivery of messages and typing indicators.
# Stream sends:
#   - 'chat-event': batches of localized events buffered every 200ms
#   - 'heartbeat': periodic keep-alive comments sent every 30s to keep connection open
# Reconnection Protocol:
#   On network interruption or node failure, client reconnects to this endpoint and invokes
#   GET /chat/{conversationId}/messages?afterId={lastSeenId} to back-fill missed events.
GET {{host}}/chat/{{conversationId}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/event-stream
